{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31111","headline":"蜀州郑史君寄鸟觜茶因以赠答八韵 · 薛能","name":"蜀州郑史君寄鸟觜茶因以赠答八韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鸟觜撷浑牙，精灵胜镆鋣。\n烹尝方带酒，滋味更无茶。\n拒碾乾声细，撑封利颖斜。\n衔芦齐劲实，啄木聚菁华。\n盐损添常诫，姜宜着更夸。\n得来抛道药，携去就僧家。\n旋觉前瓯浅，还愁後信赊。\n千慙故人意，此惠敌丹砂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛能","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31111.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31111","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}